skribidi provides bidirectional text layout, editing and glyph/icon
rasterization (https://github.com/memononen/skribidi).

    // headers: <skribidi/skb_*.h>
    // library: skribidi.lib (static, /MD), links against harfbuzz

SheenBidi, libunibreak and budouxc are compiled into skribidi.lib at the
commits Skribidi pins; they are not installed as separate packages.
